{"type":"assistant","uuid":"01a1b64f-2d1e-7fc3-b2a7-ee01f5932d04","session_id":"01a1b64b-fe4d-73dd-9fb2-26f680d0b3a8","message":{"id":"01a1b64f2d1e7fc3b2a7edff7d0829e5","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now run-tests.mjs.\n\nCareful design points recap. Also I need `verifyFullRun` to be importable by check-test-discovery.\n\nOne issue: `process.exitCode` vs immediate exit for error paths (exit 2 for bad args). Use process.exitCode and return; but for the arg error we're inside main, fine.\n\nNested guard exit 2 before doing work.\n\nLet me write.\n\nAlso perf enumeration.\n\nNote: run-tests spawns with `stdio: 'inherit'`; when A1-01 does `$r.Out -match 'run-tests: full'`, the child's stdout is inherited → goes to console → captured. ✓\n\nLet me handle the child exit: use spawn and await close.\n\n```js\nfunction runNode(args, options) {\n  return new Promise((resolve) => {\n    const child = spawn(process.execPath, args, options)\n    child.on('error', () => resolve({ code: null, signal: null }))\n    child.on('close', (code, signal) => resolve({ code, signal }))\n  })\n}\n```\n\nFor full run verification I need to read manifest.\n\nReport path printing: `manifest ${manifestPath}`.\n\nNow filtered selection reading files: read each enumerated file as utf8 and test inclusion of each ac literal.\n\nSorting of selected: keep enumeration order (sorted).\n\nEdge: duplicate `--ac` values dedupe.\n\nUpdate-snapshots: only valid for full run? Design says \"--update-snapshots：完整运行\". If combined with --ac, ambiguous. I'll allow it in both, setting env. Simpler.\n\nLet me write the code.\n\nAlso: `--perf` with `--ac` — just perf wins.\n\nOrder of arg parsing: unknown → exit 2.\n\nAlso, `--root` value: resolve relative to cwd.\n\nLet me write.\n\nAnother detail: for perf runs we should also inherit stdio and exit with child's code.\n\nPerf enumeration: if <root>/test/perf missing → none.\n\nNow the manifest read: if the file doesn't exist after a full run (e.g., node c