{"type":"assistant","uuid":"01a1b650-f787-79b7-a81d-b6007432cbdb","session_id":"01a1b64b-fe4d-73dd-9fb2-26f680d0b3a8","message":{"id":"01a1b650f78779b7a81db5fed08059d7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now the milestone-gate fixtures.\n\nm2-planned:\n- contracts/spec/ac-index.json\n- test/traceability/T-001.json, T-010.json\n- test/unit/gate.test.mjs\n- test/characterization/defects.json\n- test/characterization/defects/a3-runner.test.mjs\n- test/characterization/defects/a5-shell.test.mjs\n\nCareful: in the fixture, `mergeShards` requires T-001 entry's files to exist and contain [AC-001]. gate.test.mjs does.\n\nAlso shard task must match filename: T-001.json → task 'T-001'. ✓\n\nDefects: a3-runner has [fixed] + [repro]; a5-shell has only [repro].\n\nNote: check-defects default on m2-planned: requires a3-runner only (AC-001 covered). a3-runner has [fixed] ✓ → exit 0.\ncheck-defects --milestone M2: requires both → a5-shell missing → exit 1 ✓ (set=False, not M5).\n\nThe fixture defect tests: `test('[fixed] a3-runner fixture', () => {})`. But wait — the gate's full run enumerates test/characterization/defects/*.test.mjs. Both pass.\n\na5-shell test has only [repro]; extractTitles → plain '[repro] ...' — no [fixed] → missing. ✓\n\nm4-nocache:\n- ac-index: AC-001 T-001 M1 unit; AC-043 T-018 M3 unit; AC-055 T-022 M4 unit\n- shards: T-001 (AC-001 covered, file test/unit/gate-001.test.mjs), T-018 (AC-043 covered, test/unit/gate-043.test.mjs), T-022 (AC-055 covered, test/unit/gate-055.test.mjs)\n- defects.json: a5-nocache T-022 M4 AC-055\n- defects/a5-nocache.test.mjs only repro\n\nM3 gate: AC-001, AC-043 covered; defects required: none (a5-nocache M4 > M3) → run → pass ✓\nM4: AC-055 covered; defect missing fixed → BLOCKED with only that error. But note: errors non-empty → run-tests skipped, so no gate.file_not_executed. ✓\n\ncheck-defects default on m4-nocache: AC-055 covered → require a5-nocache → missing → exit 1 ✓.\n\nLet me write the fixture files.\n\nNote: fixture ac-index must be a valid *shape* for mergeShards (only `acs` array with ac/owner used). Gate doesn't call validateIndex. So a minimal index is fine.\n\nAlso each shard file needs `milestone` top-level? Not validated; design's T-001.json has it. I'll include for consistency.\n\nWrite them.","signature":""}],"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":null,"cache_read_input_tokens":null,"cache_creation":null,"server_tool_use":null,"service_tier":null}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"_requestId":"01a1b64c02387d24acacbd4a13028c46","_messageId":"01a1b650f78779b7a81db5fed08059d7","_meta":{"codebuddy.ai/conversationRequestId":"01a1b64c02387d24acacbd4a13028c46","codebuddy.ai/modelRequestId":"01a1b650f78779b7a81db5fed08059d7","codebuddy.ai/llmMessageId":"01a1b650f78779b7a81db5fed08059d7","codebuddy.ai/messageId":"01a1b650-f787-79b7-a81d-b6007432cbdb","traceparent":"00-1491732b1efa8226a936b146e12cfead-98331ebc19389995-01","baggage":"codebuddy.session_id=01a1b64b-fe4d-73dd-9fb2-26f680d0b3a8,codebuddy.conversation_request_id=01a1b64c02387d24acacbd4a13028c46"},"__timestamp":"2026-11-07T14:02:09.533Z"}
